      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T08:53:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It was about the AST2600\u0027s third USB controller: the device tree has ehci0 at 1e6a1000, ehci1 at 1e6a3000 and a UHCI companion at 1e6b0000, and the companion registers a root hub of its own in Linux, so counting root hubs would give three rather than two. The array already omits it, so I moved a shorter version of this next to the array where it answers why there are only two entries.",
