        "id": 1002790
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T08:53:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this relies on /sys/bus/usb/devices/ holding a symlink for every device and interface regardless of depth, which is what your realpath shows. On the AST2600 the deepest endpoint here is five ports down and resolves the same way:\n\n/sys/bus/usb/devices/1-1.2.2.4.1 -\u003e ../../../devices/platform/ahb/1e6a3000.usb/usb1/1-1/1-1.2/1-1.2.2/1-1.2.2.4/1-1.2.2.4.1\n```\n$ ls /sys/bus/usb/devices/1-1.2.2.4.1/1-1.2.2.4.1:1.0/net\nmctpusb8\n```",
      "parentUuid": "f5e83950_546ceda3",
